{"lyrics":"[00:06.62]Enviyon on the mix\n[00:12.42]No, no, no, no\n[00:14.06]No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no\n[00:21.14]No, no, no, no\n[00:21.44]I still see your shadows in my room\n[00:22.50]Can't take back the love that I gave you\n[00:23.58]It's to the point where I love and I hate you\n[00:27.70]And I cannot change you, so I must replace you, oh\n[00:37.56]Easier said than done, I thought you were the one\n[00:46.22]Listenin' to my heart instead of my head\n[00:54.16]You found another one, but I am the better one\n[00:57.02]I won't let you forget me\n[01:00.86]I still see your shadows in my room\n[01:05.54]Can't take back the love that I gave you\n[01:08.32]It's to the point where I love and I hate you\n[01:13.78]And I cannot change you, so I must replace you, oh\n[01:16.58]Easier said than done, I thought you were the one\n[01:20.52]Listenin' to my heart instead of my head\n[01:24.98]You found another one, but I am the better one\n[01:31.16]I won't let you forget me\n[01:32.88]You left me falling and landing inside my grave\n[01:37.20]I know that you want me dead\n[01:40.50]I take prescriptions to make me feel a-okay\n[01:45.76]I know it's all in my head\n[01:46.50]I have these lucid dreams where I can't move a thing\n[01:55.66]Thinking of you in my bed\n[02:01.76]You were my everything, thoughts of a wedding ring\n[02:06.02]Now I'm just better off dead (uh, uh, uh)\n[02:11.84]I'll do it over again\n[02:15.72]I didn't want it to end\n[02:16.60]I watch it blow in the wind\n[02:26.62]I should've listened to my friends\n[02:28.80]Leave this shit in the past\n[02:29.60]But I want it to last\n[02:30.98]You were made outta plastic, fake\n[02:33.10]I was tangled up in your drastic ways\n[02:35.42]Who knew evil girls have the prettiest face?\n[02:37.60]You gave me a heart that was full of mistakes\n[02:41.46]I gave you my heart and you made heartbreak\n[02:43.12]You made my heart break\n[02:47.04]You made my heart ache (I still see the shadows in my room)\n[02:50.64]You made my heart break\n[02:52.96]You made my heart ache (can't take back the love that I gave you)\n[02:57.10]You made my heart break (were made outta plastic, fake)\n[03:03.14]You made my heart ache (I still see the shadows in my room)\n[03:07.32]You made my heart break again (I was tangled up in your drastic ways)\n[03:12.82](Who knew evil girls have the prettiest face?)\n[03:16.60]I still see your shadows in my room\n[03:26.16]Can't take back the love that I gave you\n[03:36.42]It's to the point where I love and I hate you\n[03:39.02]And I cannot change you so I must replace you, oh\n[03:44.84]Easier said than done, I thought you were the one\n[03:47.52]Listening to my heart instead of my head\n[03:48.88]You found another one, but I am the better one\n[03:50.36]I won't let you forget me\n[03:54.90]I still see your shadows in my room\n[03:59.06]Can't take back the love that I gave you\n[04:01.10]It's to the point where I love and I hate you\n[04:03.32]And I cannot change you so I must replace you, oh\n[04:30.32]Easier said than done, I thought you were the one\n[04:31.44]Listening to my heart instead of my head\n[04:32.36]You found another one, but I am the better one\n[04:33.38]I won't let you forget me\n[04:34.00](Leave this shit in the past but I want it to last)\n[04:35.16](You were made outta plastic, fake)\n[04:35.88](I was tangled up in your drastic ways)\n[04:36.70](Who knew evil girls have the prettiest face?)\n[04:37.60](Easier said than done, I thought you were)\n[04:38.42](Instead of my head, you found ano-, better one)\n[04:39.46](I won't let you forget me)","words":[[6.62,9.24,"Enviyon"],[9.3,9.34,"on"],[9.76,9.86,"the"],[9.9,11.34,"mix"],[12.42,12.5,"No,"],[12.82,12.86,"no,"],[13.08,13.24,"no,"],[13.84,13.88,"no"],[14.06,14.08,"No,"],[14.16,14.18,"no,"],[14.22,14.24,"no,"],[18.94,19.12,"no,"],[19.16,19.28,"no,"],[19.5,19.64,"no,"],[19.74,19.8,"no,"],[19.84,20.82,"no,"],[20.94,21.02,"no,"],[21.06,21.08,"no"],[21.14,21.18,"No,"],[21.26,21.28,"